he Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog. No personal or system data will be transmitted."Winbindex Sync Prompt:"PatchTrace needs your explicit consent to connect to Winbindex (github.com/m417z/winbindex) to fetch Windows binary metadata and KB mapping indices. No personal or system data will be transmitted."Symbol Server Fetch Prompt:"PatchTrace needs your explicit consent to connect to the Microsoft Symbol Server (msdl.microsoft.com) to download binaries and debug symbols required for patch diffing. No personal or system data will be transmitted."3. Data ContractsAll stored local records adhere to strict typed schemas with mandatory provenance fields. Size caps are enforced on all ingested strings and arrays.CveRecordJSON{
